Subject: win32u: publish the display driver's provider in its class key

OSHI reads DriverDesc, ProviderName and DriverVersion together. Publish the
same provider already used for DEVPKEY_Device_DriverProvider when creating
the adapter class key, including after Wine rebuilds its display devices.

--- a/dlls/win32u/sysparams.c
+++ b/dlls/win32u/sysparams.c
@@ -1650,6 +1650,7 @@
     set_reg_value( hkey, memory_sizeW, REG_DWORD, &value, sizeof(value) );
 
     set_reg_ascii_value( hkey, "DriverVersion", driver_vendor_to_version( pci->vendor ) );
+    set_reg_ascii_value( hkey, "ProviderName", driver_vendor_to_name( pci->vendor ) );
     NtClose( hkey );
 
 
